{"server":"cn","storyId":"act11mini_level_act11mini_st06","groupId":"act11mini","stageId":null,"title":"真实故事","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st06.txt","sourceHash":"a55337d38956a9677b9d8f7026e2e5666ec94cb77c65877d781af9a5096ac6a2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰斯顿对着“很”字沉思了片刻，从枕头套里翻出一封泛黄的信，信封上的寄信人是“K先生”，收信人是他自己。\n借着囚室外面的微光，他低声念着上面的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“请在监狱内安心蛰伏一段时间，切勿惹人关注，不要惹是生非......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“您仍是沙滩伞公司的重要雇员，我们仍为您保留一切职位和待遇......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“只要您在监狱中表现良好，等到时机成熟，我们一定还您自由，并给予您加倍的补偿......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公司的那群人反应太慢，都什么时候了，才把这封信寄到我手里。"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰斯顿摇了摇头，小心翼翼地把信纸折好，塞进信封，放回枕头套里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥伦比亚俚语*，那么刺激的梦，居然被一泡尿给毁了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，这不是杰斯顿吗，你又在熬夜写信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"上周你就写信，今天你又写信，你到底是写给谁的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这和你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么好藏着掖着的，就不能给我们看看吗？你到底在写什么呢？向爹妈要钱？威胁老婆不许出轨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天和别人打了赌的，赌注是十根香烟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我你在写什么吧。要是赢了烟，我分你一半。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"非常抱歉，我要求你尊重我的隐私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，隐私、隐私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"假扮狱警混进来杀人，人没杀到，自己倒成了囚犯，就这还装什么优雅，要什么隐私？笑死人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"人都到齐了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿还没来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿？他又怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"他出门的时候自己不小心，一头撞在铁栅栏上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常抱歉，我去医务室了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"医务室？那你摔得不轻啊，“同事”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，谁绊的你？看在你这段时间老老实实的分上，说出来，我帮你出出气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有人绊我，我是自己撞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别三天两头往医务室跑！谁不知道你比铁栅栏还硬，瞎往医务室跑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人好好干活！杰斯顿，你过来，我有别的活派给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，我就和其他犯人一样工作就行——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"啰嗦什么，过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，这是桶，这是清洁剂，拿好了，把整个A区囚室的厕所刷一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，如果这是您安排的任务的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，您还没给我刷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"用什么刷子呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你杰斯顿神通广大，用源石技艺变个钢丝球出来还不是轻而易举？去吧！刷完来找我验收，不干净不准吃饭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈、哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所愿，狱警先生，毕竟此时此地，您才是掌握权力的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，被人罚刷厕所，他还装起来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"干那种脏活，真是辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一点小事而已，没什么好在乎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"这是午餐的面包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢，瑞克，不枉我上午替你去医务室打探消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是撞到铁栅栏，是为我装病去的医务室吗？我都不知道怎么感谢你好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我的病怎么样......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个医生难缠得要死，我花了一笔小钱才撬开他的嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按他说的，你的肝病已经不能再拖了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你又在这里“交朋友”了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么我管不着，但是今天的群架你得参加！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我没兴趣参与你们的娱乐活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"没兴趣？你知道我们A区最近被那帮感染者打得多惨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"自从你一通瞎折腾把安东尼放跑之后，B区的人越来越无法无天，这都是你的责任，你还好意思不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不去就等着吧，下次你再被人叫去扫厕所，我们会给你准备“惊喜”的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我不像你们这样粗俗，无法从这种低俗的暴力中得到什么快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你还是去吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"那边那个叫瑞克的，你才来几天？我告诉你，离这个人远点，他可不是什么善茬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不是善茬？怎么会呢，杰斯顿帮了我不少忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"切，好言难劝该死的鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，一会儿就开打了，我劝你赶紧过去！迟到了小心我们一起招呼你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们非要我到场不可，那我就去看看好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不是到场看看——你得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，总之你得给我过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"看看是谁来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你穿囚服的样子挺好看啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"狱警当腻了，来与我们同乐了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）杰斯顿，我听说你能和安东尼扳手腕，放倒这些人应该不在话下吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么蠢问题。我甚至觉得你在羞辱我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"区区几个感染者——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"听见了吗，感染者渣滓们，杰斯顿说区区几个感染者，根本不够他打的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"好哇，我们倒要看看这个假扮的狱警有几斤几两！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我们上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，又打起来了——瞧瞧那是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我赌今天A区占上风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就要亏了。我赌A区一点便宜也占不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你在那站着干什么，你以为自己是根柱子吗，打他们啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你这个——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你*哥伦比亚俚语*当内奸是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，A区的混蛋，你们根本不够我们打的！你们搬的救兵根本不打算帮你们，等着被打死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"打死他们也没什么好玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"你不觉得现在这里最该揍的不是A区的残废，而是这个光说不练的假狱警吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"他刚刚说什么来着，“区区几个感染者，根本不够他打的”，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就看他来气，他不打我我也要打他一拳——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥伦比亚俚语*，我感觉我骨折了......他就是块铁疙瘩，打他跟打钢板没区别！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"尝尝撬棍的厉害！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"打得好！打这个没良心的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨）打不痛他的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"撬棍弯了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"B区的弱智，这家伙会法术，你们不知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"说得好像你们拿他有办法一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，他是你们请来帮场子的，他不出手，你们请他跟请了一尊雕像来有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你可想好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生们，我劝你们冷静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从一开始就没答应过要加入你们粗俗的斗殴，站在这里已经是我对你们最大程度的忍让了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们还有一点理智，就请给我让开一条路，让我离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你还长篇大论上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我们请你来是让你帮忙的，不是让你观战的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，你是忘不了假扮狱警的时光，跑这儿来回忆过去了是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"吃我一扳手！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"手腕生疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生们，我没心情陪你们继续闹下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们越是想击伤我，越是会伤害到自己本就不健康的身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，在斗殴中得到快乐，我真的不敢恭维这种品味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身为囚犯已经够可悲了，而缺乏最基本审美品味的囚犯......啧啧啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"*一连串哥伦比亚俚语*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"弟兄们，我们一起揍他，看他能扛到什么时候！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......他不是A区的人请来帮场子的吗？他们自己打起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要不是在牢里，我现在一定下楼买桶爆米花吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们现在怎么办？看戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"看什么戏，不是说了没有爆米花吃吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是一起打这个*哥伦比亚俚语*了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你不打架，跑这儿来干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我去拿点东西，给大家找点乐子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"（耳语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，记得回来，不回来小心我扒了你的皮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，记住你自己说的。要是你敢弄别的东西回来，我就让你把撒谎的教训记一辈子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"明白明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"他说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"别管了，等着看戏吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我已经有点看腻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"这杰斯顿也真是硬得可以，别人连锯条都崩了好几根，他连道伤口都没有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯们","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯们","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不是我的本意，不过从结果上看，你们似乎已经无力再战了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的到来加速了你们握手言和的进程，也不失为一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，先生们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“哗——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么——强酸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，这是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"呕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"臭死了，谁从哪儿搞来的臭水？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，你不是很行吗，不是品味很高吗，不是谁都拿你没办法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"我请你用你自己刷厕所的水洗个澡，你感觉如何啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"你要干嘛？打我？来啊，你刚才不是还要我们冷静吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我无意和你们这样的粗鄙之人过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"软蛋！脓包！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们爱怎么说怎么说，爱怎么做怎么做，但这些秽物伤不了我分毫，这样的下作手段除了凸显你们的无聊之外毫无作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我都有点佩服这个人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A区囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"走走走，我们都要被你熏死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B区囚犯C","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧回去哭吧，记得上床之前换套衣服，免得把你的床铺也弄得臭烘烘的，哈哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，我就问你怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我非得给B区那小子加餐不可——等下，那我们刚才打的赌怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是我赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了我说的话了？我赌的是“A区一点便宜也占不到”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"你个油嘴滑舌的骗子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿？你怎么样，他们没伤到你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"呕......臭死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"他们对你做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些暗算，不必介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"他们怎么能这样？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有多余的囚服吗，借我一套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也只有一套换洗的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"......杰斯顿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦你回自己牢房等一会儿，我去擦个身子，洗洗衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"你穿的是湿衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......我刚才不该那么吝啬，我把自己换洗的囚服给你带来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这种天真的同情心......我已经等不及看这个蠢货读信之后的蠢脸了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他已经足够感激我了，接下来就是稍作引导，燃起他的仇恨......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真幸运啊，我短暂的入狱时光中还能有这么一个消遣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿？你怎么了，不舒服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说你的事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告里面说，你的肝病是酗酒导致的，虽然你入狱之后不再接触酒精，但工作中接触的化学制品仍然会对你的身体造成损伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生亲口跟我说，再这样下去，你的预期寿命就不太乐观了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，我的妻子，我七八岁的孩子，我害苦你们了，我真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到这个，医生不光给我看了你的检测报告，还把你妻子寄来的信给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"信？帕蒂给我写信了？为什么会在医生那里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生说，是为了你的健康考虑，他不想让你太过激动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他已经把你的状况告诉我，现在再瞒着你这封信的事也就没意义了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"谢天谢地，帕蒂给我来信，我就算死在这也值了！她说什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......你自己看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但愿我上周熬夜模仿的笔迹和他老婆的足够相似。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"“我怀着悲伤的心情通知你，这样的生活我再也过不下去了，我决定嫁给比尔——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我——杰斯顿，这真的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂要嫁给我十五岁的弟弟？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（见鬼，他弟弟叫比尔？！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——好好想想，是不是还有其他人叫这个名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人，其他人......迪金森家的木匠，我入狱前刚死了老婆的那个？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我要当面找帕蒂对质！她怎么能因为这种事就抛下我，让我们的孩子管那个又老又瘸的木匠叫爸爸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，瑞克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，我真是——我不知说什么好，如果不是你把这封信带给我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞克，现在不是说谢谢的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说谢谢的时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都知道，在哥伦比亚，一切都逃不开金钱或权力的支配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想，为什么帕蒂会跟那个木匠跑掉？因为钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你进了监狱，成了她的负担，所以她宁可嫁给一个又老又瘸的家伙，也不愿继续留在深爱着她的你的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想复仇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"复仇？不，我只是想当面问问帕蒂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？你就打算这么放过她？就算你想放过她，难道你连自己的孩子都不要了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为帕蒂爱你，你也爱她，可是在哥伦比亚，爱能卖多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂背叛了你，她还要教你的孩子学会如何背叛自己真正的父亲！难道你心中没有一丝愤怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，求你别说了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个天真过头的傻瓜......看来我得说得更直白一点。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（没问题的。就算告诉他我很快就能出去，这个蠢货也不会嫉妒，只会羡慕我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我们只有一个选择，那就是把金钱和权力攥到自己的手里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"金钱......和权力？这些东西怎么让我夺回自己的孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了金钱，你就可以交一笔保证金，通过假释离开这个鬼地方，从帕蒂手里把自己的孩子抢回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是有钱，一开始就不会被人陷害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只剩权力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞒你说，我在这座监狱内外都有一些关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一些很可靠的朋友，他们过段时日就会把我捞出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过这么多年的摸爬滚打，我多多少少也摸到了权力的边缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之所以会被困在这座监狱里，不过是因为一些不幸的意外和拖延，只是一些小插曲罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿，谢谢你，谢谢你愿意和我这样一个苦命人说话，帮我办事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自信一点，瑞克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥伦比亚，只要你自己足够有用，或者有人愿意拉你一把，你就不会永远是一个苦命人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不夸张地说，我属于前者，而你则是后者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"后者——有人愿意拉我一把......难道你愿意帮我出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算把自己的一些关系介绍给你，让你也能和上面的那些人说上话，假以时日......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瑞克！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"瑞克·格雷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"是——到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"出去，有人找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"别磨磨蹭蹭的！你这个走了狗屎运的混蛋，你家里人筹到了足够的保证金，赶紧去办你的假释手续！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊——我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁......是谁给我筹的钱？我的父亲吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"别问东问西的了，你到底还想不想出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"求您了，请您告诉我，究竟是谁给我交的保证金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"啰嗦！是个叫帕蒂的，和你一个姓，满意了吧？赶紧滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，“同事”，我们又见面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能有人给这个穷鬼交保证金？难道是你们——不，这不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不可能，谁会为了一个囚犯掏钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，别以为我不知道你搞的这些小把戏。你爱“交朋友”的习惯已经连典狱长都知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"他特地让我来看着你一点，别让你搞出什么乱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以还是你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"别搞错了，这家伙真的只是运气好而已。他老婆好像是卖了房子还是怎么样，反正凑够了保证金，就这么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"要说我们在其中起了什么作用......我们只是小小地拖延了一下办事手续而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拖延？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一周前就知道他老婆凑够保证金了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"这一周看你跑上跑下，拿自己那点可怜兮兮的钱到处打点关系——噗，噗哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你兜里还剩几个子儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰斯顿目露凶光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的物质开始在他手上凝结——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，你想来真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后消退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有愚人才用暴力发泄自己的愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"真遗憾，自从安东尼越狱之后，上面就给我们配发了超大功率的电击枪，我还想试试呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去在其他人身上试吧，你很快就没机会再见到我了，粗鲁的狱警先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，也有人给你交保证金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保证金......当然会有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更有趣了，既然有人给你交保证金，为什么你还没像那个瑞克一样走人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浅薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为真正掌握着金钱和权力的人会用钱从监狱里捞人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，口气不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈述事实而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就祝你早日被人捞出去，而且是不用钱的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在你还是曼斯菲尔德监狱的犯人，懂吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"懂就拿着这个桶和这瓶清洁剂，你还有C区的厕所没刷呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰斯顿在落款处停住了。\n他用力握着笔杆，牙关紧咬，最终划去了原来的落款。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样......这样应该足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神，杰斯顿，打起精神......你是沙滩伞公司连续五年的最佳员工，他们不会放弃你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不会放弃你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，他们一定不会放弃你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了，就快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出去之后，一定要想个法子让这群下作的囚犯和狱警——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰斯顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_540_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，这个还是等出去之后再说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰斯顿·威廉姆斯将何去何从？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沙滩伞公司的K先生会不会对他们困境中的员工施以援手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请锁定58台，下周同一时间，我们继续为您带来《真实故事》第173期！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A&路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈、哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"这节目我追定了，叫什么来着，《真实故事》是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说你会喜欢的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这个节目的老观众了，但像这个演杰斯顿的演员这么好的演技，我还是头一回见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"看来58台也下了血本了，这么好的演员，他们从哪儿找到的？他以前演过别的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。《真实故事》这节目主打的就是伪纪录片，从来不放演职员表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是哪个表演学院新毕业的学生吧，我打赌他未来一片光明，前途大好，哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"敬前途大好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"敬前途大好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"这酒真不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好酒，好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我说啊，我就一说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"假如那人不是演员，真是犯人——你觉得怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你这笑话讲得真不赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"太好笑了，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（音乐）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"《真实故事》为虚构作品，如有雷同，纯属巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们下期节目再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
